{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"淨行品第十一","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"爾時智首菩薩問文殊師利菩薩言.佛子菩薩雲何得無過失身語意業.雲何得不害","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"身語意業.雲何得不可毀身語意業.雲何得不可壞身語意業.雲何得不退轉身語意","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"業.雲何得不可動身語意業.雲何得殊勝身語意業.雲何得清淨身語意業.雲何得無","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"染身語意業.雲何得智爲先導身語意業。雲何得生處具足.種族具足.家具足.色具足.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"相具足.念具足.慧具足.行具足.無畏具足.覺悟具足。雲何得勝慧.第一慧.最上慧.最勝","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"慧.無量慧.無數慧.不思議慧.無與等慧.不可量慧.不可說慧。雲何得因力.欲力.方便力.","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"緣力.所緣力.根力.觀察力.奢摩他力.毗鉢舍那力.思惟力。雲何得藴善巧.界善巧.處善","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"巧.緣起善巧.欲界善巧.色界善巧.無色界善巧.過去善巧.未來善巧.現在善巧。雲何善","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"修習念覺分.擇法覺分.精進覺分.喜覺分.猗覺分.定覺分.捨覺分.空.無相.無願。雲何得","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"圓滿檀波蜜羅.尸波蜜羅.羼提波羅蜜.毗黎耶波羅蜜.禪那波羅蜜.般若波羅蜜.及以","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"圓滿慈悲喜捨。雲何得處非處智力.過未現在業報智力.根勝劣智力.種種界智力.種","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"種解智力.一切至處道智力.禪解脫三昧染淨智力.宿住念智力.無障礙天眼智力.斷","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"諸習智力。雲何常得天王.龍王.夜叉王.乾闥婆王.阿修羅王.迦樓羅王.緊那羅王.摩睺","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"羅伽王.人王.梵王.之所守護恭敬供養。雲何得與一切衆生爲依爲救.爲歸爲趣.爲炬","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"爲明.爲照爲導.爲勝導爲普導。雲何於一切衆生中爲第一爲大.爲勝爲最勝.爲妙爲","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"極妙.爲上爲無上.爲無等爲無等等。爾時文殊師利菩薩告智首菩薩言.善哉佛子.汝","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"今爲欲多所饒益多所安隱哀愍世間利樂天人問如是義。佛子若諸菩薩善用其心","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"則護一切勝妙功德.於諸佛法心無所礙.住去來今諸佛之道.隨衆生住恆不捨離.如","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"諸法相悉能通達.斷一切惡.具足衆善.當如普賢色像第一.一切行願皆得具足.於一","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"切法無不自在.而爲衆生第二導師。佛子雲何用心能獲一切勝妙功德。佛子.","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"菩薩在家　當願衆生　知家性空　免其逼迫。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"孝事父母　當願衆生　善事於佛　護養一切。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"妻子集會　當願衆生　怨親平等　永離貪著","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若得五欲　當願衆生　拔除欲箭　究竟安隱","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"伎樂聚會　當願衆生　以法自娛　了伎非實","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若在宮室　當願衆生　入於聖地　永除穢欲。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若瓔珞時　當願衆生　捨諸僞飾　到真實處","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"上昇樓閣　當願衆生　昇正法樓　徹見一切","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若有所施　當願衆生　一切能捨　心無愛著","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"衆會聚集　當願衆生　捨衆聚法　成一切智","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若在厄難　當願衆生　隨意自在　所行無礙。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"捨居家時　當願衆生　出家無礙　心得解脫","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"入僧伽藍　當願衆生　演說種種　無乖淨法","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"詣大小師　當願衆生　巧事師長.　習行善法","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"求請出家　當願衆生　得不退法　心無障礙","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"脫去俗服　當願衆生　勤修善根　捨諸罪軛","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"剃除鬚髮　當願衆生　永離煩惱　究竟寂滅","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"著裟袈衣　當願衆生　心無所染　具大仙道","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"正出家時　當願衆生　同佛出家　救護一切","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"自歸於佛　當願衆生　紹隆佛種　發無上意","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"自歸於法　當願衆生　深入經藏　智慧如海","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"自歸於僧　當願衆生　統理大衆　一切無礙","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"受學戒時　當願衆生　善學於戒　不作衆惡","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"受闍梨教　當願衆生　具足威儀　所行真實","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"受和尚教　當願衆生　入無生智　到無依處","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"受具足戒　當願衆生　具諸方便　得最勝法。","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若入堂宇　當願衆生　昇無上堂　安住不動","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若敷床座　當願衆生　開敷善法　見真實相","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"[一]正身端坐　當願衆生　坐菩提座　心無所著","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"結加趺坐　當願衆生　善根堅固　得不動地","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"修行於定　當願衆生　以定伏心　究竟無餘","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若修於觀　當願衆生　見如實理　永無乖諍","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"捨加趺坐　當願衆生　觀諸行法　悉歸散滅。","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"下足住時　當願衆生　心得解脫　安住不動","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若舉於足　當願衆生　出生死海　具衆善法","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"著下裙時　當願衆生　服諸善根　具足慚愧","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"整衣束帶　當願衆生　檢束善根　不令散失","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"若著上衣　當願衆生　獲勝善根　至法彼岸","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"[一]無性攝論五引所行清淨經.作若見坐時發如是心.願諸衆生坐菩提座.","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"著僧伽黎　當願衆生　入第一位　得不動法。","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"手執楊枝　當願衆生　皆得妙法　究竟清淨","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"嚼楊枝時　當願衆生　其心調淨　噬諸煩惱","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"大小便時　當願衆生　棄貪瞋癡　蠲除罪法","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"事訖就水　當願衆生　出世法中　速疾而往","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"洗滌形穢　當願衆生　清淨調柔　畢竟無垢","sortOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"以水盥掌　當願衆生　得清淨手　受持佛法","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_400","text":"以水洗面　當願衆生　得淨法門　永無垢染。","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_400_76","chapterId":"ch_w